      <img src="{{ 'learn-img-a044820100.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" style="height: 58px; margin-bottom: 22px; opacity: 0.9;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: var(--pm-cacao-700); margin: 0 0 16px;">Taste What Hasn't Been Taken Away</h2>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--pm-cacao-600); max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 auto 30px;">Ready to experience whole-food cacao the way it was meant to be prepared? Explore Pacha Mana's Chuncho ceremonial cacao and taste the full 50/50 bean, intact.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <x-import component-from-global-scope="PachaManaDesignSystem_9805b9.Button" variant="primary" size="lg">Shop Chuncho Cacao</x-import>
        <x-import component-from-global-scope="PachaManaDesignSystem_9805b9.Button" variant="outline" size="lg">Read The Series</x-import>
      </div>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--pm-cacao-600); margin: 22px 0 0;">More from the guide: <a href="/raw-cacao-myth" style="color: var(--pm-cacao-700); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">why raw cacao is a myth</a> and <a href="/coffee-alternative-cacao" style="color: var(--pm-cacao-700); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">replacing coffee with cacao</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Series band -->
  <div style="background: var(--surface-card); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);">
    <div style="max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px;">
